{"id":"vorschlag","lemma":"Vorschlag","pos":"noun","rank":1584,"glosses":["suggestion, proposal (something proposed)","an ornament in which one or more notes are added before the principal note, such as an appoggiatura or acciaccatura","the wad in a muzzleloader"],"ipa":"/ˈfoːɐ̯ʃlax/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/16/De-Vorschlag.ogg/De-Vorschlag.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Vorschlages","plural":"Vorschläge"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich habe einen Vorschlag.","en":"I have a proposal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/390536","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Ich möchte dir einen Vorschlag machen.","en":"I'd like to make you a proposal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745336","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Vorschläge sind willkommen.","en":"Suggestions are welcome.","words":[null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"welcome"}]},{"text":"Hast du irgendwelche Vorschläge?","en":"Do you have any suggestions?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"any"},null]},{"text":"Hast du einen Vorschlag?","en":"Would you have a suggestion?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]}]}